From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:49:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] power: supply: iceland-supervooc: gate every start on
 the battery authentication

Stock checks the battery authentication before any fast charge; the driver
reported it but started anyway by default (auth_gate=0). Make auth_gate=1 the
default; auth_gate=0 still only reports.

Based on dappermint/iceland-supervooc commit 614469fabe59 ("ci: run the host tests on every push");
builds on DocZ13's SC8547D handover in iceland-linux issue #2 and on OnePlus's open-source oplus_chg code.

Link: https://github.com/dappermint/iceland-supervooc

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/iceland_supervooc.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/iceland_supervooc.c b/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/iceland_supervooc.c
index 2938c945c85d4..3cb3c01a02125 100644
--- a/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/iceland_supervooc.c
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/iceland-supervooc/iceland_supervooc.c
@@ -86,7 +86,8 @@ static bool arm;
 /* read-only after load: a bad combination is refused at load, a runtime write could not be checked */
 static unsigned int stage = 2, pumps = 1, cap_100ma = UNSET_U, hold_s = UNSET_U, conn_max_c = 60, soc_min = UNSET_U, soc_max = UNSET_U;
 static int temp_min = UNSET_I, temp_max = UNSET_I;	/* 0.1 C; an unset value takes the stage's default (vl4_default) at load */
-static bool stock_start, auth_gate, auto_start;
+/* iceland: the battery authentication gates every start by default (stock does; dappermint: report only) */
+static bool stock_start, auth_gate = true, auto_start;
 /* iceland: the module refuses to load unless enable=1 is given explicitly (no hardware access before that) */
 static bool enable;
 module_param(enable, bool, 0444);
-- 
